      "writtenOn": "2020-09-22T22:04:26Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Unrelated; this is because we call shutdownVpnRunner() from the executor thread now in cases of configuration failures (eg Authetication failures), and if the executor is already shut down, the next VPN will fail to start because exitVpnRunner() throws (submit called on shutdown executor).\n\nThis is a new use case for calling shutdownVpnRunner, since it\u0027s now being used on the internal thread as well.",
      "parentUuid": "94dc0ec0_12d2360c",
